mark-shot (0.2.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add multi-region capture mode with transparent gaps/holes and editor handoff.
  * Refine ruler edge snapping, collapsible readout toggles, selection frames, and eyedropper tip dragging.
  * Preserve scrolling screenshot overlap alignment across list hover highlights.
  * Harden Wayland portal capture, global shortcut registration, DMA-BUF recording fallbacks, and zero-frame encoder shutdown.
  * Automate stable AUR package updates for mark-shot and mark-shot-bin after GitHub Release publication.

 -- Mark Shot maintainers <snemc@qq.com>  Sat, 28 Nov 2026 17:05:00 +0900

mark-shot (0.2.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add simple double-arrow length style for ruler annotations.
  * Show top-left zoom percentage HUD, snap nearby wheel zoom to 100%, and display Wayland pin action/OCR feedback capsules.
  * Negotiate PipeWire buffer parameters for Wayland portal capture and gracefully finish portal recordings when authorization closes.
  * Support legacy --tray autostart migration, avoid startup shortcut popups, and clean up Windows standby workers on tray exit.

